# VevuPay — Google Play Store listing draft

## App name
VevuPay

## Short description (80-character limit)
Manage your VevuPay wallet, send money, top up and pay everyday bills.

## Full description
VevuPay brings everyday payments together in one app.

Use VevuPay to manage your wallet, send money to other VevuPay users, buy airtime and data, pay supported electricity and cable TV bills, purchase supported education pins, and keep track of your transactions.

WHAT YOU CAN DO

• Wallet: view your available wallet balance and transaction activity.
• Transfers: send money to other VevuPay users with transaction authorization.
• Airtime: top up supported mobile networks.
• Data: browse and purchase available data bundles.
• Bills: pay supported electricity and cable TV services.
• Education: purchase supported examination and education pins.
• Cashback and rewards: view eligible rewards and referral activity where available.
• Notifications: receive account and transaction updates.
• Account security: manage your password and transaction PIN.

VevuPay services, limits, fees and eligibility may vary by account status, provider availability and applicable terms. Review transaction details before confirming a payment.

For support and account information, use the support options provided in the app or visit the VevuPay website.

