## Still required before submission
- Actual phone screenshots captured from the finished Android app.
- Developer contact email and phone (if requested by Play Console).
- Final public privacy-policy URL confirmation.
- Completed Play Console Data safety form based on the actual SDKs and backend data flows.
- Financial features declaration: VevuPay includes mobile wallet/payment and money-transfer features; declare these accurately in Play Console.
- Review the in-app betting-wallet funding feature before submission. Google Play's real-money gambling policy restricts non-gambling apps from providing gambling support/companion functionality, including management of participation funds. The Play Store build may need that service hidden/disabled unless VevuPay qualifies under the applicable licensed gambling-app process.
- Confirm the legal operator, payment-provider relationships and any required Nigerian regulatory/partner disclosures.
- Content rating questionnaire and target-audience declaration.
- App access instructions for reviewers if sign-in is required.
- Final signed Android App Bundle (AAB).

Do not submit this draft until the app's final features, privacy policy, financial-service disclosures and Play Console declarations have been checked against the production build.
